# E10 harness: never commit corpus snapshots or throwaway databases.
# The archive JSON (frozen-input-manifest.json, comparison.json,
# summary.md, arm-summary.json, q*.json) IS committable — corpus bodies
# are not. These patterns guard against an operator accidentally pointing
# scratch output inside the experiment directory.
snapshot/
**/snapshot/
db-*/
**/db-*/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
